        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    prices = [120, 123, 121, 125, 130]\n    volumes = [1500, 1600, 1550, 1700, 1800]\n\n    # Calculate the cumulative Volume Price Trend\n    vpt = 0\n    for i in range(1, len(prices)):\n        price_change = (prices[i] - prices[i - 1]) / prices[i - 1]\n        vpt += price_change * volumes[i]\n\n    # Return the VPT at the end of the fifth day\n    return round(vpt, 2)\n```",
